---
import Base from "../layouts/Base.astro";
import { site } from "../data/site.js";
import { breadcrumb } from "../lib/schema.js";
const schema = [breadcrumb([{ name: "Home", path: "/" }, { name: "Privacy Policy", path: "/privacy-policy/" }])];
---
<Base
  title="Privacy Policy | Southlake Fire Restoration"
  description="Privacy policy for Southlake Fire Restoration: how calls and information are handled when you contact us for fire damage restoration in Southlake, TX."
  path="/privacy-policy/"
>
  <script type="application/ld+json" slot="head" set:html={JSON.stringify(schema)} />

  <div class="wrap"><div class="crumbs"><a href="/">Home</a> / Privacy Policy</div></div>

  <section class="hero">
    <div class="wrap" style="max-width:820px">
      <span class="kicker">Legal</span>
      <h1>Privacy Policy</h1>
      <p class="lead">This policy explains what information {site.brand} collects when you use this website or call the number listed, and how that information is used.</p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section>
    <div class="wrap prose" style="max-width:820px">
      <h2>Who We Are</h2>
      <p>{site.brand} operates the website {site.domain}. We are a free service that helps homeowners in Southlake, TX and the surrounding area connect with independent local service providers for fire and smoke damage restoration. The service providers who perform any work are independent businesses and are not employed by {site.brand}.</p>

      <h2>Information We Collect</h2>
      <p>When you call the phone number on this site, standard call information such as your phone number and the details you provide about your situation may be collected to route and respond to your request. If you contact us by other means, we collect the information you choose to share, such as your name, contact details, property location, and a description of the damage. This website may also collect standard, non-identifying technical data such as browser type, device, and pages visited through common web analytics.</p>

      <h2>How Information Is Used</h2>
      <p>Information you provide is used to understand your request and share it with an independent local service provider who can help with fire and smoke damage restoration. That means the details you share about your property and the damage may be shared with a service provider so they can respond to you. We do not sell your personal information.</p>

      <h2>Calls</h2>
      <p>When you call the number on this site, your call may be answered, routed, or returned by a service provider or a third party working on their behalf. By calling, you consent to your call being handled in this way so that your request can be addressed.</p>

      <h2>Cookies &amp; Analytics</h2>
      <p>This site may use cookies and third-party analytics tools to understand how visitors use the pages and to improve the site. You can set your browser to refuse cookies or to alert you when cookies are being sent; some parts of the site may not function as intended if cookies are disabled.</p>

      <h2>Third-Party Links</h2>
      <p>This site links to third-party resources, such as government and nonprofit fire-recovery pages. We are not responsible for the privacy practices or content of websites we do not operate. Review the privacy policy of any third-party site you visit.</p>

      <h2>Your Choices</h2>
      <p>You may choose not to provide certain information, though this may limit our ability to share your request with a service provider. If you would like to ask about the information associated with your request, contact us using the phone number on this site.</p>

      <h2>Changes To This Policy</h2>
      <p>We may update this policy from time to time. Any changes will be posted on this page. Your continued use of the site after changes are posted means you accept the updated policy.</p>

      <h2>Contact</h2>
      <p>Questions about this privacy policy can be directed to {site.brand} at <a href={site.phoneHref}>{site.phone}</a>.</p>
    </div>
  </section>
</Base>
